---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="页面未找到" noindex>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl py-16 text-center">
    <p class="accent-text m-0 font-mono text-[3rem] font-bold leading-none">404</p>
    <h1 class="m-0 mt-4 text-[1.5rem] font-semibold tracking-tight">这个页面不存在</h1>
    <p class="muted mt-3">链接可能已经失效，或者文章被移动到别处了。</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="btn">回到首页</a>
      <a href="/search/" class="btn">搜索文章</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

